 split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s3","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"We trained each model for 30 epochs with a batch size of 128.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s4","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Figure 1 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s5","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Evaluated on SVHN, ResNet-50 comes in at 89% validation accuracy (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s6","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"As shown in Figure 1, Evaluated on AG News, ResNet-50 comes in at 116.1% validation accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s7","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Evaluated on SST-2, ResNet-50 comes in at 53.5% validation accuracy (Figure 1).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s8","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"ResNet-50 reaches 43.5% validation accuracy on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s9","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Figure 2 shows the accuracy of ResNet-50 by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s10","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"ResNet-50 scores 10.7 points higher on IMDB than on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s11","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"ResNet-50 reaches 79.6% accuracy on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s12","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Evaluated on SST-2, ResNet-50 comes in at 88.9% accuracy.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s13","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"ResNet-50 achieves 127.6% accuracy on IMDB (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s14","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Figure 3 shows the test accuracy during training.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s15","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"From epoch 6 to epoch 10, the test accuracy of GRU improves by a relative 4.9%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s16","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"At epoch 16, EfficientNet is 4 points better than GRU.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s17","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Epoch 2 sees VGG-16 post a test accuracy of over 50% (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s18","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"As shown in Figure 3, GRU reaches 75.0% test accuracy at epoch 12.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s19","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"Random Forest reaches 61.1% accuracy on MNIST.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_002_s20","report_id":"phrasing_002","text":"We note that the training was stable for all models.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}